{
  "compilerOptions": {
    "composite": true,
    "target": "ES2022",
    "module": "ESNext",
    "moduleResolution": "bundler",
    "lib": ["ES2023"],
    "types": ["node", "electron-vite/node"],
    "strict": true,
    "noUnusedLocals": true,
    "skipLibCheck": true,
    "esModuleInterop": true,
    "resolveJsonModule": true,
    "allowJs": true,
    "isolatedModules": true,
    "noEmit": true
  },
  "// exclude": [
    "A malha de encontro (mqtt, encontro, malha) roda na interface e nos",
    "testes, nao no processo principal. Ela usa WebCrypto e WebSocket, que",
    "vivem na lib DOM; incluir DOM aqui daria ao processo principal tipos de",
    "APIs de navegador que ele nao tem. Excluir e mais honesto do que mentir",
    "sobre o ambiente."
  ],
  "exclude": [
    "src/shared/mqtt.ts",
    "src/shared/encontro.ts",
    "src/shared/nostr.ts",
    "src/shared/malha.ts"
  ],
  "include": [
    "src/main/**/*.ts",
    "src/preload/**/*.ts",
    "src/shared/**/*.ts",
    "src/servidor/**/*.d.ts",
    "electron.vite.config.ts"
  ]
}
